<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia updates list of frozen MinFin bonds.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia updates list of frozen MinFin bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of $14.64 million nominal of MinFin bonds are still frozen, according to an updated list of frozen bonds issued by the Russian finance ministry and Vneshekonombank on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The list takes into account the decision by the police earlier this month to release some of the bearer securities. A ministry spokesman said no further bonds had been frozen or added to the list.</p>
